####  Text file implementation:
```java
private static final String FILE_PATH = "emergency_fund.txt"; // this one at the top, before initialize()

private void loadTextFileData(){
    requestList.clear(); // Clear existing collection / list

    List<String> lines = TextFileUtil.readLines(FILE_PATH);

    if (lines != null) {
        for (String line : lines) {
            if (line == null || line.trim().isEmpty()) {
                continue; // Skip empty lines
            }

            String[] parts = line.split(","); // or line.split(";") depending on delimiter

            // common Logic starting:
            if (parts.length >= REQUIRED_PARTS_COUNT) {

                // Parse strings into model object attributes
                ModelClass mc = new ModelClass(
                    parts[0].trim(),
                    parts[1].trim(),
                    parts[2].trim(),
                    Double.parseDouble(parts[3].trim()),
                    Boolean.parseBoolean(parts[4].trim())
                    // ... custom logic parsing here
                );

                requestList.add(mc);
            }
        }
    }

    // Attach loaded list to TableView
    tableView.setItems(requestList);
}
```

